/*
Switch case statement:
----------------------
	If we want to execute no of cases we use switch case statement.

Syntax:
	switch(condition)
	{
	case 1:
		statement 1;
		break;
	case 2:
		statement 2;
		break;
	................
	..............
	case n:
		statement n;
		break;
	default:
	}
Example:
  */
